Contour plots showing the interactions of different parameters, namely temperature, pH, and incubation period, for C. tropicalis isolates A C4, B U873, C U951, and D U1179Fig. 3
Desirability profiles for the C. tropicalis isolates A C4, B U873, C U951, and D U1179 showing predicted responses and overall desirability as functions of temperature, pH, shaker speed, inoculum size, and incubation time. Green dashed lines and error bars indicate variation across the modelled response range

